---
description: Best practices for error tracking with Sentry
globs: **/*.ts,**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---
- Initialize Sentry early in your application lifecycle.
- Use Sentry's breadcrumb feature to track user actions leading to errors.
- Implement custom error handling with Sentry's captureException method.
- Set up release tracking and source maps for better error context in production. 
